<details class="<%= local_assigns[:header] ? 'header-drawer manual-drawer' : 'rules-drawer' %>">
  <summary>Field manual<% if local_assigns[:header] %> <b>?</b><% end %></summary>
  <div class="rules-content">
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Watch I</h3>
      <p>Draw six cards, assign two Commands, commit the rest as Support, and take two actions. Supply and Command tags carry forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Midwatch Event</h3>
      <p>Resolve one unforeseen event. Events are not previewed and Command tags cannot block them.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Watch II &amp; Endure</h3>
      <p>After Watch II, resolve the visible crisis using Readiness from both Watches. Then clean up; Supply normally expires and Data banks.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">04</span><h3>Inner &amp; Outer Reach</h3>
      <p>Some Inner worlds require a foundation technology. Every Outer world requires both listed technologies and a later action to colonize.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rules-warning">
      <b>Mandate &amp; loss conditions</b>
      <p>Secure 5 Colonies, including 2 Outer, and complete 1 doctrine. Stability 0 ends the run. Fleet 5 ends it unless you have 2 Colonies and the Defense Grid.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
